  "document": "The Wife Takes a Flyer\nThe Wife Takes a Flyer( aka Highly Irregular, UK title: A Yank in Dutch) is a 1942 romantic comedy film made by Columbia Pictures, directed by Richard Wallace. The film stars Joan Bennett and Franchot Tone. The screenplay of\" The Wife Takes a Flyer\" was written by Jay Dratler, Gina Kaus and Harry Segall. The film's music score is by Werner R. Heymann."
